        "id": "kaikki:b4179eb2a082e520ba",
        "definition": "An institution where one can place and borrow money and take care of financial affairs.",
        "example": "Finance is seldom romantic. But the idea of peer-to-peer lending comes close. This is an industry that brings together individual savers and lenders on online platforms.[…]Banks and credit-card firms are kept out of the picture. Talk to enough people in the field and someone is bound to mention the “democratisation of finance”.",
